WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 47 - The
Flames of Love

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:44.350
Fire. My fire.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:47.600
An etude for fire - for
the Scarlet Angel.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.830
Fire... My fire.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:13.860
When I dance like this, next to the fire...
my arms, my wrists, my legs -

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.720
all of them will remember
the rhythm of the flames.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.200
I want to see Kichiza.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.510
This is the fire of love - of
love so strong, it hurts.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.800
That's how Oshichi
was consumed.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:02:59.910
Miss Ayumi?

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.830
Are you all right?

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.350
What are you doing
here, Mr. Hamille?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:11.780
I came to enjoy the beauty of Japan's
outdoors and to photograph you in it.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.910
But if I may ask, what
are you doing?

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.090
I'm trying to become fire.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.430
Fire?

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.630
I'm trying to remember
its rhythm.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.230
I have to remember
it with my body.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.870
I want to see you!
I want to see you!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:37.480
If another fire starts, I know
I'll see you again!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.710
I'll see you!

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:50.460
This is Oshichi.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:54.060
This is her heart which smoldered
and disintegrated in flames.

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.970
I am Oshichi.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:03.800
Now, I would like you to perform
your rendition of fire.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.410
We shall start with
you, Ayumi.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.780
Flames!

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:30.350
This is the movement of
fire... the rhythm of fire!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.340
This fire burns intensely.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.900
This is Ayumi's flame.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:46.220
Thank you, Ms. Tsukikage.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:51.170
Bravo, bravo, Ayumi!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.880
It was as though you were
the very essence of fire!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.170
You're next, Maya.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.450
Yes!

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.600
"Arson is a capital offense."

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.180
"If I'm caught, I'll
be put to death."

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.690
This is <i>Yaoya Oshichi</i>!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.450
How does she know it?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.130
"Edo is burning!"

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:48.710
She's climbed to the top
of the watchtower.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:10.820
"Now I'll finally get to see
you again, Kichi."

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.480
"It's so hot up here, Kichi!"

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.810
"Everything's going
up in flames!"

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.870
"Both you and I as well."

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.840
That's enough.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.850
Both of you showed your individuality
and it was an interesting watch.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.840
Ayumi's fire was so beautiful that it evoked
an image of the essence of fire,

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:41.530
and Maya, while your performance was unrefined,
it did well to depict the fire of the heart.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:48.800
But Maya, there wasn't a look of all-consuming
love in the eyes of your Oshichi!

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.370
Being fascinating and acting well
aren't necessarily the same thing.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:57.710
Fascinating acting can draw
people in, even without skill.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.600
Because the scent of
reality is present.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.040
Maya, I want you to
fall in love for real.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.970
Fall in love...

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:06.980
...for real?

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:11.550
After you've done that, I'd like to see your
rendition of <i>Yaoya Oshichi</i> again.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:17.470
But, why did Maya
pick that play?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.590
Your next topic is water.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.100
Your stage will be right here.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.520
Acting out water.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:30.070
My own depiction of water.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.630
Kaikei, the Buddhist
woodcarver.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:41.580
This is worthy of the carvings
Isshin made.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:45.880
I'd like to meet Kaikei,
the carver.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:52.970
I guess his real name must
be Seiji Yamamoto.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.670
Yes, I'm Seiji Yamamoto.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:05.540
Excuse me, but are you the famous
Buddhist carver, Kaikei?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.920
Yes. I am.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:13.570
This is... Kaikei?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.870
Acting out water.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.850
My water.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:41.260
Mist is another form of water.

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.600
Water is changeable...

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.180
Water.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:00.150
It binds all life together.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.890
Water.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.080
The source of life.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.250
Cool!

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.170
We can't live without water.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.420
Acting out water.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.300
You want to know about
<i>Yaoya Oshichi</i>?

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:31.830
Yes. I want to know why you picked
that particular play to act out fire.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.720
I was talking to this old man about
how I was having trouble...

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:40.330
finding a way to act out fire, and then we started
talking about <i>Yaoya Oshichi</i>.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.990
An old man?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.960
Yeah. He's very friendly and
he looks like a nice old man.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:55.790
When I was rehearsing for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>,
I acted out <i>Yaoya Oshichi</i> for fire too.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:59.630
I poured my love for
Ichiren into that role.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.640
That was my fire...
my madness.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:10.000
There are only a handful of people
who know about that.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.240
It can't possibly be that man...

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.410
You don't say...

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.250
So, that girl actually acted out <i>Yaoya
Oshichi</i> for her depiction of fire.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:28.100
That must have given Chigusa
quite a shock.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.940
So, they're acting
out water next...

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.080
Yes.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.340
We're going to the home of
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.490
You're back!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.510
I'm home!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.470
Dad! Today, there was
this thing...

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:50.040
In what way is this guy a
Buddhist woodcarver?

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:53.090
He looks so ordinary.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.210
What a place to breakdown!

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:01.040
He's taking his sweet time...

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.050
Oh no, the car!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.880
My father's car drove
off a cliff?

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.300
Mr. Masumi!

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:44.700
We have recovered the vehicle, but Eisuke
Hayami has not yet been found.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.680
My sincerest apologies,
Mr. Masumi.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.500
Don't give up.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.700
Do everything you
can to find him.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:59.210
Please don't leave
like this, Father.

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:02.730
Our battle has not yet ended.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.130
Acting out water.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.030
It's strange, because I feel like I almost
have it, but I don't know what it is.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:26.270
Seeing all those stars up there
in the sky is just incredible.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.250
A shooting star!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:40.410
Too bad! I should have
wished for something!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.310
And what would you
have wished for?

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.770
Mr. Hayami!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.020
What are you doing here?

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.770
I'm looking for someone.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.540
You are?

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.520
Yeah. General Centipede.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.980
General Centipede was a man who fell in love
with the beautiful spirit of the plum tree,

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.750
without considering how
ugly he was himself.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:09.880
He tried everything to make her his, so he ate not
only the leaves off the tree, but also its branches...

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:12.510
and its trunk, until the whole
tree was destroyed.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:19.650
He ate the entire plum tree, but the beautiful
spirit still escaped his grasp.

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:26.770
That was when Centipede realized
how sinful he had been.

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:30.930
He realized that he
also had a son.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:35.010
Anyway, I'm here to find General
Centipede. He's gone missing.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:39.010
President Hayami is missing?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:43.780
I don't think he'd want you to worry
about him, so don't think about it.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.220
You should head back. You're
going to catch cold.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.260
What about you?

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:52.560
I'm going to lay back and
look at the stars!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.190
No fair. I'm staying!

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.180
I found this spot first, anyway.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.760
Don't chase me away.

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:01.900
Be stubborn then.
See if I care.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.760
I will, since you're so nosy.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:11.600
It's strange, but being here with
you like this is very relaxing.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.040
How's your Scarlet Angel
coming along?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.770
It's hard.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.980
Just try your best.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:23.440
I'm sure there are a lot of people waiting
to see how your Scarlet Angel turns out.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:30.280
Mr. Hayami... Mr. Purple Roses...

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:42.530
If I ever perform as the Scarlet Angel, I want
him to be the first person to see my rendition.

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.930
I want to perform <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>
for him as well as for myself!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:52.750
I'm just waiting for that man to
come and tell me his identity.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:15:01.860
What a lucky fan you have,
to be thought of so highly.

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:03.290
Mr. Hayami!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.760
A shooting star.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.570
Did you make a wish?

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.780
Did you?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.530
My wish will probably
never come true.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.080
Mr. Hayami...

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.860
Let's go.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:29.610
Let me give you a hand. Unless
you don't want me to.

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:49.150
I never really noticed how warm
his hands are until now.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:55.050
I wish this starry sky could
just go on forever...

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:59.550
The reason I don't focus exclusively
on my Buddhist carvings...

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.810
is because I wish to remain
grounded in this world.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:07.300
A family register is tightly
linked to human fate.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:12.470
It's just a single sheet of paper, but there are
so many human lives squeezed onto it.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:17.850
Joy, sorrow, rage and leisure:
all are entangled on it.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.690
This is what Isshin's
face looks like.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.680
His eyes.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.160
His form.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.260
I guess they still haven't
found President Hayami.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:04.240
I heard he was a heartless,
scary old man,

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:07.220
but I guess Mr. Hayami is
still worried about him.

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:15.790
And this is where Ryuujin
is enshrined.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.010
Ryuujin?

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.340
He's a water god.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.730
A water god?

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:25.950
All the water on this mountain - the rivers,
the lakes and the waterfalls...

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.760
are all controlled by Ryuujin.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.570
Sometimes, Ryuujin ascends into the
sky and calls upon the clouds...

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.000
to make the rain fall.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:46.410
You don't want to make him angry!
It can be very frightening if you do.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:51.160
He can cause floods or droughts; he's
the god who commands water.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:54.380
Ryuujin is the god who
commands water.

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.890
My water.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.910
Water. It connects all life.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:10.960
Fish cannot live
without water.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:15.540
And people cannot
live without love.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.920
Water's love?

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:42.230
The Little Mermaid was
undone by love...

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.450
My water...

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:48.930
I never thought I'd meet you in
a mountain temple like this.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:52.670
I was wondering if you knew anything
about my father's whereabouts.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.470
So, he's still missing?

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:58.700
It was a very steep cliff. There's
little hope of finding him alive.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:03.830
But I won't give up.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.280
Not until I find my father.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:13.890
Do you love your father,
Mr. Masumi?

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.630
I don't, Ms. Tsukikage.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.560
Ryuujin is the god of water!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:39.360
The rain and the mist are
all parts of his heart!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:44.490
How do I express
his rage and joy?

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.520
No, this isn't the way.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.510
Scarlet plums.

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.040
The Valley of the Plums.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.520
The rumors say a dragon protects
the Scarlet Angel that lives there.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.850
The dragon of the Valley
of the Plums.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:20.250
So, this is the home of
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.590
Maya!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.100
Mr. Hayami!

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.510
What are you doing here?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:41.550
Don't worry about that.
You're frozen!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.840
We should look for a place
to stay until the rain stops.

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.030
Are you cold?

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:58.000
Mr. Purple Roses is always
protecting me.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:14.190
Mr. Hayami... the fan who's been cheering
me on since the beginning without fail.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.340
Mr. Purple Roses.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:22.590
Those words... all those things you've
done... they've all been for me.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:29.830
You gave all your
kindness... to me.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.460
I finally know.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.750
I love you...

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.740
Mr. Hayami.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:22.860
Water.

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:24.460
It transforms as it flows.

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:26.500
If it goes up into the sky,
it becomes a cloud.

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:27.770
If it falls to the ground,
it becomes rain.

00:23:27.770 --> 00:23:28.890
If it freezes, it becomes ice.

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:33.180
It changes when the temperature changes,
and inside it, there's the essence...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.320
of life.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.290
We can't live without it.

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:38.870
And then, there's earth.

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:41.270
Mother Nature fosters
our growth.

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:45.300
What are you, Maya Kitajima?

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:50.500
Here I am, wracking my brains, and then you
go and do something totally unimaginable!

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 48 - A
Night of Dreams
